## 4 · White Section Rules (`bg-white`)

- Background: white (no bg div needed, or explicit `bg-white`)
- Headings: `text-heading`
- Body text: `text-muted`
- No motif

### White section bg snippet
```astro
<Fragment slot="bg">
  <SectionBg variant="white" />
</Fragment>
```

### Card on White bg
```astro
<div class="rounded-lg bg-card-light p-4 md:p-5 flex flex-col">
  <h3 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-1 text-heading">{title}</h3>
  <p class="text-[13px] md:text-[14px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
</div>
```

- Background: yellow tint (`rgb(237 217 116 / 50%)`) — same as CTA banner style
- No border on light cards

### Ghost button on White bg

```astro
<a href="/path" class="btn-ghost-light">Button Label</a>
```

Or use the Button component:
```astro
<Button variant="ghost-light" text="Button Label" href="/path" />
```

