## 7 · FAQ Section (follows the section color flow)

FAQ sections are **not fixed to a specific background** — they take whatever background colour falls at their position in the page's colour flow (White → Grey → Black).

- **No cards** — FAQ is an accordion with no card wrappers around items
- The `FAQs` component (or equivalent accordion) is used directly
- Text contrast must match the background:

| Background | Section heading | Question text | Answer text |
|---|---|---|---|
| White | `text-heading` | `text-heading` | `text-muted` |
| Grey (`#FAFAFA`) | `text-heading` | `text-heading` | `text-muted` |
| Black | `text-white` | `text-white` | `text-accent` (yellow) |

### FAQ on White or Grey bg
```astro
<Fragment slot="bg">
  <!-- White: nothing needed -->
  <!-- Grey: -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FAFAFA] dark:bg-slate-900/30"></div>
</Fragment>
```

### FAQ on Black bg — pass `isDark` and bg snippet

When `isDark={true}` is set, the `FAQs` component automatically applies:
- Section heading: `text-white`
- Question text: `text-white`
- Answer text: `text-accent` (yellow)
- Dividers/borders: `white/20`
- Toggle icon: `border-white/30 text-white/50`, open state `border-accent text-accent`

```astro
<FAQs
  isDark={true}
  title="Frequently Asked Questions"
  items={[...]}
>
  <Fragment slot="bg">
    <SectionBg variant="dark" />
  </Fragment>
</FAQs>
```

---

## Hard Rules (never break these)

| Rule | Detail |
|---|-----|
| No `card-hover` | Cards are always static — no lift/shadow on hover |
| No gold bar | Never add `<span class="gold-bar">` under any heading |
| No eyebrow text | No tagline/eyebrow above H2 headings |
| Grey is always `#FAFAFA` | Never use `bg-gray-50` or any other grey value |
| Black card bg is always `#222` | Use `bg-[#222]` — not `bg-zinc-800`, not `bg-black` |
| Use SectionBg component | Always use `<SectionBg variant="..." />` for section backgrounds — never manual pattern code |
| Motif is site config | Shape / fade / tile / which sections: `src/config/motif.ts`. Color / opacity: `CustomStyles.astro`. R&C: hero 10%, dark 12%, CTA 3% |
| Hero badges only when explicit | Never add `tag-pill` badges unless the content brief lists them |
| CTA card has no border | The yellow card uses `bg-accent` only — no `border` class |
| FAQ has no cards | FAQ is a plain accordion — never wrap items in card divs |
| FAQ on Black bg | `isDark={true}` — heading `text-white`, questions `text-white`, answers `text-accent` (yellow) |
| Ghost button on Black | Use `btn-ghost-dark` class or `variant="ghost-dark"` |
| Ghost button on White/Grey | Use `btn-ghost-light` class or `variant="ghost-light"` |
| Testimonials on Grey with black cards | Set `isDark={true}` for white text on cards, override headline with explicit dark text classes |
| Card on White section | Yellow tint background (`50%`), no border |
| Card on Grey section | Black background (`bg-[#222]`), yellow border, white text |
